<title>USA: U.S. business loans rose $300 mln in March 19 wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans rose $300 mln in March 19 wk.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks rose $300 million to $804.3 billion in the week ended March 19, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
